OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1785676707
OL,3,CAmber heat health alert to come into
OL,4,Cforce in East Midlands
OL,6,FThe UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA)
OL,7,Fhas issued an amber heat health alert
OL,8,Ffor the East Midlands.
OL,10,FIt is in place from 9am on Monday 3
OL,11,FAugust until 9am on Wednesday 5 August
OL,12,Fand replaces a less severe yellow
OL,13,Falert which was previously in place.
OL,15,FTemperatures are expected to reach 30C
OL,16,Fin some parts of the region.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/4
