FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1785676707
OL,3,CAmber heat health alert to come into
OL,4,Cforce in East Midlands
OL,6,FThe UKHSA is warning of possible
OL,7,F"significant impacts" on health and
OL,8,Fsocial care services, including a rise
OL,9,Fin deaths among those aged 65 and over
OL,10,For people with health conditions, and
OL,11,Fan increase in drownings.
OL,13,FDr Anya Gopfert, a consultant in
OL,14,Fhealth protection at UKHSA, said: "We
OL,15,Fknow that even moderate heat can lead
OL,16,Fto serious health problems, especially
OL,17,Ffor older people and those with
OL,18,Fcertain health conditions, so it's
OL,19,Fimportant that everyone takes simple
OL,20,Fprecautions while enjoying the warm
OL,21,Fweather over the coming days.
OL,26,@oD@AOUoD@UO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/4
