OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,342,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F341A1785676707
OL,3,CAmber heat health alert to come into
OL,4,Cforce in East Midlands
OL,6,F"If you have friends, family or
OL,7,Fneighbours who are more vulnerable, it
OL,8,Fis important to check in on them and
OL,9,Fensure they are aware of the forecasts
OL,10,Fand are following the necessary
OL,11,Fadvice."
OL,13,FIt comes after July was recorded as
OL,14,Fbeing 3C above average across the UK,
OL,15,Faccording to provisional Met Office
OL,16,Fdata on the month so far.
OL,18,FLess severe yellow alerts have been
OL,19,Fissued for the West Midlands, which
OL,20,Fwas declared as being officially in
OL,21,Fdrought last week.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/4
